# The repo-root .gitignore ignores `package.json`/`package-lock.json` at any
# depth (its own dependency-less-repo convention), which would also hide
# this test suite's manifest. Un-ignore just those two files here — this
# suite is the one place in the repo that legitimately needs npm deps.
!package.json
!package-lock.json

node_modules/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
